Network Troubleshooting commands:
💠 ping : checks connectivity to remote server.
💠 netstat : display active network connections,listening ports and routing information.
💠 curl : fetches a webpage content.
💠 traceroute: show network path to a host.
💠 telnet: test wheather a specific server and port are rechable.
💠 dig: checks DNS records and verifies domain name resolution.
